-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:43 | regulation 75 of those Regulations; and
-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:44 | (b) the in-building or localised on-site installation or operation
-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:45 | of the equipment specified in the Schedule.
